Description:
The biotechnological company GiStem Research Limited is sited in Gijón (Asturias, Spain) and was founded in 2016 by researchers working at various public and private R&D entities. It is supported by the Foundation for the Research on Uterine Stem Cells (Spanish acronym: FICEMU).

Our main goal is to offer a new therapeutic line based on the secretome or conditioned medium (CM) derived from human Uterine Cervical Stem Cells (hUCESCs). 

Our company engages in a field in full expansion, such as biotechnology, more specifically in a fast growing area, that of stem cells and regenerative medicine. 

Four special scientific and technological aspects are paramount and give our company its genuine character:

•	We have already developed a new biological product CM-hUCESCs derived from stem cells, which is commercially patented and presents great therapeutic potential;

•	The possibility of obtaining large quantities of this product within a short period of time;

•	The pioneering use of this product derived from hUCESCs, which allows avoiding the technical and safety inconveniences attached to using stem cells themselves, thus enhancing the chances of carrying out clinical tests;

•	The therapeutic potential of this product in three very attractive medical fields: regenerative medicine, oncology and  inflammatory diseases.

EmbryoTools has been founded by Scientists with an international reputation for innovation and excellence and who are passionate about reproduction and best practices. With more than 30 years experience in both Clinical Embryology and Animal Reproduction, we provide a wide range of expertise to reproductive specialists, centers and manufacturers.

We hold the highest standards and drive for excellence. All our services are performed in our own state of the art facilities, with the most advanced technology and innovative techniques.

Our team looks forward to contribute to the IVF Global community by:

- Providing the most advanced and profound Quality Control Testing for products for the IVF industry;
- Sharing our experience and expertise with other laboratory professionals in our Training School;
- Proving Independent Scientific and Clinical Consulting Services to reproductive centers to improve results with best practices and protocols and assist manufacturers on developing and optimizing new products for IVF based on our long term experience and deep understanding of IVF industry needs;
- Developing the most innovative techniques through continuous research in our Animal Reproduction Center.

Let us be your partner in success!

//Misión//

MICOLOGIA FORESTAL & APLICADA (MF&A) es una empresa de biotecnologia que investiga, desarrolla y comercializa tecnologías y productos para el cultivo de setas silvestres y trufas. Pioneros en la siembra directa de setas en árbol adulto (Mycoforest technology), produce micorrizas para el sector forestal y agrícola, así como planta micorrizada. MF&A aplica su tecnología a explotaciones forestales de todo el Mundo.

//Visión//

Las setas silvestres son un producto ecológico, no todas producibles en granjas y con una elevada demanda internacional. Su recolección y comercialización ha generado una industria muy importante impulsada por la 
gastronomía. La explotación del recurso micológico permitirá una reforestación de calidad rentable y sostenible.


//Mission//

MICOLOGIA FORESTAL & APLICADA ( MF & A) is a biotechnology company that researches, develops and markets technologies and products for the cultivation of wild mushrooms. Pioneers in direct mushroom infection in adult trees  (Mycoforest Technology), We produce mycorrhiza inocula for forestry, agriculture and infected seedlings . MF & A applies its technology to forest holdings throughout the World. 

//Vision//

The wild mushrooms are an organic product, with a high international demand. Its harvest and marketing has generated a very important industry driven by cuisine demands. The exploitation of the micological resource will allow for cost-effective and sustainable reforestation.
